</span></td>
<td id="S4.SS5.p2.pic1.2.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S4.SS5.p2.pic1.2.7.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:186.4pt;">
