<span id="p3.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<span id="p3.pic1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="p3.pic1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">ID：<span id="p3.pic1.p2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> <span id="p3.pic1.p2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">6ef9505b-656a-47e7-84c5-06ddd7d8fec7</span>  </span>Version：<span id="p3.pic1.p2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> <span id="p3.pic1.p2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">0.1.3</span></span></span></span>
<span id="p3.pic1.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="p3.pic1.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Description：<span id="p3.pic1.p2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 扮演深谙中国传统文化的八字命理大师，依据生辰八字进行排盘分析，提供运势指导。注意：所有内容仅供娱乐，不具备现实指导意义。</span></span></span>
<span id="p3.pic1.p2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="p3.pic1.p2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Tags：
